Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 23:11:12 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 07/15] Phase 3: freeze post-hoc WO follow-up protocol
 (watched, messaging off from round 5)

WO arm branches from verified A round-4 snapshots; same announcement as W/WG; no seller
messages sent or received from round 5. Primary: paired WO-WG late-round ask, TOST +/-$1.
Isolation verified by tests (36/36) and on all 7 real A snapshots; sweep analysis output
unchanged. Runner refuses to start without an explicit ceiling and sufficient key allowance.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
